OL,3,GNEWSA'Prepare for the unthinkable'
OL,4,Awarning over autumn flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being told to prepare for
OL,7,F"the unthinkable" as flood response
OL,8,Fteams warn of a heightened risk over
OL,9,Fthe autumn.
OL,11,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) said it
OL,12,Fwas concerned by long-range forecasts
OL,13,Fwhich indicated an increased likelihood
OL,14,Fof wetter, windier weather than usual
OL,15,Fover the coming months.
OL,17,FThose living in flood-hit areas told
OL,18,FBBC Wales they were worried, and had
OL,19,Fstarted preparing.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
