OL,3,GNEWSA'Prepare for the unthinkable'
OL,4,Awarning over autumn flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne in seven properties in Wales is
OL,7,Fclassed as being at risk of flooding,
OL,8,Fbut NRW said just 27% of those eligible
OL,9,Fto receive flood warnings to their
OL,10,Fphone or email were currently signed
OL,11,Fup.
